  "data": {
    "body": "Four protons, each of mass \\textit{m} and charge +\\textit{e} are initially held at the corners of a square that is \\textit{d} on a side. They are then released from rest.\n\nWhich of the following equations will you need to solve to determine if the speed \\textit{v} of each proton, when the protons are very far apart?",
